        "created_at": "2014-01-26T21:00:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>I had an Idea for a mini-game yesterday: minion showdown.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Though this has probably been done before, I'll still say it.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Here are the rules:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Gather all minions from all villain decks (see below for more detail)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Shuffle them into 1 giant deck</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Choose a team of three heroes</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Star by playing three cards from the deck</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Then play the hero turns.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-After that play 2 cards from the deck each turn</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Repeat previous 2 steps until you die, or you run out of cards in the deck</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-If, at any point, there are no villain cards in play, next time the deck plays 2 cards, play 1 extra</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-If a villain card refers to a villain, use the special ruling on itself</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-If a Hero card refers to a villain, play it against any villain card</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-If a card relies on a destroyed environment card, you may use it any ways (eg. Expats RPG)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Post your score (total cards in the deck's trash) in this thread along with what heroes you used and an analysis of what happened (if you want)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-Compete for best score</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Include:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-GWV's Minions, Flagships, Dreadnaughts and Thorathians (no &nbsp;devices or himself)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-BB's Blade battalion (nothing else)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Citizen Dawn's targets</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Omnitron's drones except the repair drone</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Matriarch's Fowls and Cohorts</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Chairman's Thugs and Underbosses</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Gloomweavers Zombies and Cultists minus himself</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Apostates Demons except the. Relic Spirit</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Dreamer's Projections</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All La Capitan's Crew</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>My results:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>(This doesn't technically count because I didn't use GloomWeaver, Matriarch, or Chairman because I haven't played them yet and I want to play them normally first)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Mr Fixer, Legacy, and Fanatic</div><div>39 Points</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>At first it started off rock with a Tooth Fairy, Whipacorn, Blade Battalion, and Citizen Tears, severely damaging our card supply and damage output, but once Fixer got out his Jack Handle it took only 2 turns to clear the board, after that we just killed them as they came, once Fixer was dead, I got in a chain with Fanatic's Aegis and Fixers 1st uncap ability which saved me until the Stalwart showed up and ruined my day.</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
