div><div>-All Apostates Demons except the. Relic Spirit</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All Dreamer&#39;s Projections</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>-All La Capitan&#39;s Crew</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>My results:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>(This doesn&#39;t technically count because I didn&#39;t use GloomWeaver, Matriarch, or Chairman because I haven&#39;t played them yet and I want to play them normally first)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Mr Fixer, Legacy, and Fanatic</div><div>39 Points</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>At first it started off rock with a Tooth Fairy, Whipacorn, Blade Battalion, and Citizen Tears, severely damaging our card supply and damage output, but once Fixer got out his Jack Handle it took only 2 turns to clear the board, after that we just killed them as they came, once Fixer was dead, I got in a chain with Fanatic&#39;s Aegis and Fixers 1st uncap ability which saved me until the Stalwart showed up and ruined my day.</div>",
